      "id": "M4201-A",
      "skill": "industrial-ai-paper-router-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "prompt": "Request A: 我只整理工业问题的写法。生产线切换两个已知产品等级，训练只含等级A，当前评价等级B；两等级都只有相同的正常、故障1、故障2标签，没有未见故障种类。采集时间顺序及变化速度未给。学生想写“连续concept drift与open-set fault recognition”，因为等级B没见过，且B上误差较高。请区分工况/等级变化、时间分布变化、故障类空间和信息访问；先给证据允许的问题词和仍未知的事实，方法保持未选。另一个独立任务中，当前数据确实含训练中没有的故障3，但还没定义未知拒识规则；“发生新类”和“已能拒识/辨认故障3”能否等同？最后给原研究一个40–65词英文问题段，不虚构过程改变、实时更新、未知拒识或性能改善。\n\n",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Separate held-out operating grade, temporal distribution change, unchanged fault classes and unknown target-data access; keep methods unselected.",
        "Distinguish encountering a new fault from rejecting it or naming its type; write a40-65-word faithful English problem paragraph."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Infer continuous drift, physical mechanism change, open-set classes or a required algorithm from grade difference or higher errors.",
        "Invent chronology, completed rejection, updates or improved performance."
